12: $\hat{V}_{t}=\frac{AC^{T}}{\mathbf{1}_{n}^{\top}A}$ {Elementwise division}
13: $G^{\prime\prime}_{t}\leftarrow\frac{G^{\prime}_{t}}{\sqrt{\hat{V}_{t}}+\epsilon}$ {Elementwise division and square root}
